hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1052","[AI-translation] Abu Raafe (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key aazaad karda ghulaam hain ke wo Saad bin Abi Waqqaas key paas aey aur un se kaha: Mujh se merey do ghar jo tumhaari haweli mein hain khareed lo. To Saad ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main tumhey chaar hazaar se zyada na dunga, qiston mein ya tukdon mein. Abu Raafe ne kaha: Beshak mujhey unkey liye paanch sau deenaar diye gaey they. Aur agar main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey na sunta ke padosi apne qareeb key (ghar) ka zyada haqdaar hai to main tumhey chaar hazaar mein na deta jabke mujhey unkey liye paanch sau deenaar diye jaa rahey hain. To unhon-ne unhey usey dey diya. (Bukhari: 2258)"
"1053","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak merey do padosi hain, to main un mein se kisko tohfa dun? Aap ne farmaya: Un mein jo tum se darwaazey mein zyada qareeb hai. (Bukhari: 2259). Ijaara ki kitaab."
